+        expire: Callable[[], None],
+    ) -> None:
+        """Arranges for ``expire()`` to run when ``timeout`` passes, unless
+        ``waiter`` has completed by then.
+
+        The timeout is cancelled as soon as ``waiter`` is done, and timed-out
+        waiters are periodically garbage collected.
